  "body": " Lines of Equal Profit   Use your graph of the fundraiser region R and the profit shillings from .     Show that the plans , and each earn Ksh . Plot them. What do you notice?    Draw the lines of plans earning Ksh and Ksh . How are the three lines related?    Lay your ruler along the Ksh line and slide it parallel to itself, away from the origin. Which point of R does it touch last? What is the profit there?    Does the Ksh line meet R? What does that tell the class?      "
