  "body": " The True Area Lies Between   For from to with strips, the trapezoidal estimate is ( ) and the mid-ordinate estimate is . Without knowing the exact area, what can you say about it?    The ordinates are : . The curve bends downwards like an arch, so underestimates and overestimates. The true area lies between and . (A computer gives to 2 decimal places.)   "
